(DRAGON EVOLUTION BRANCHES, STATS, AND SKILLS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-05-11) Tj
T*
(Source: Topnotch direction in Dragonforge Discord) Tj
T*
(Status: Product/design proposal for implementation planning) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CONFIRMED DIRECTION) Tj
T*
(-------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The game should feel like a cute hatchling growing into a mythical dragon.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Adventure scale should evolve with the dragon:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Hatchling - dungeon crawling) Tj
T*
(   - Small, cute, scrappy.) Tj
T*
(   - Encounters feel like cave rooms, ruins, tunnels, mushroom grottos, underground) Tj
T*
(   shrines.) Tj
T*
(2. Drake - forest adventuring) Tj
T*
(   - More confident and mobile.) Tj
T*
(   - Encounters feel like wild trails, monster dens, bandit camps, ancient groves.) Tj
T*
(3. Young Dragon - raiding towns) Tj
T*
(   - Dragon fantasy becomes more dominant.) Tj
T*
(   - Encounters include guards, watchtowers, caravans, town squares, treasure houses.) Tj
T*
(4. Dragon - raiding cities) Tj
T*
(   - Large-scale fantasy threat.) Tj
T*
(   - Encounters include city gates, battlements, guild halls, royal vaults, mage towers.) Tj
T*
(5. Ancient Dragon - mythical domination) Tj
T*
(   - Endgame identity.) Tj
T*
(   - Encounters become kingdoms, sky citadels, divine temples, rival ancient dragons,) Tj
T*
(   world bosses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EVOLUTION TIMELINE TARGETS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Evolution pacing should create long-term attachment without making early progression) Tj
T*
(feel stalled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Hatchling -> Drake: 2-4 hours) Tj
T*
(- Drake -> Young Dragon: 3-7 days) Tj
T*
(- Young Dragon -> Dragon: about 1 month) Tj
T*
(- Dragon -> Ancient Dragon: 3-6 months) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Design implication:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Hatchling and Drake need frequent visible progress.) Tj
T*
(- Young Dragon is where build identity becomes serious.) Tj
T*
(- Dragon is the long midgame prestige goal.) Tj
T*
(- Ancient Dragon is aspirational/endgame and can support very rare materials, long quest) Tj
T*
(chains, and seasonal progression.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
