(BATTLE SCREEN DIRECTION) Tj
T*
(-----------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Battle chapters should focus almost entirely on combat.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Required battle screen elements:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Dragon HP bar) Tj
T*
(- Enemy/boss HP bar) Tj
T*
(- Roguelike experience bar for the current chapter/run) Tj
T*
(- Level-up moment offering 3 skill choices) Tj
T*
(- Skill choices from both:) Tj
T*
(  - general skill pool) Tj
T*
(  - evolution/element-specific skill pool) Tj
T*
(- Info button for:) Tj
T*
(  - current stat profile) Tj
T*
(  - selected skills) Tj
T*
(  - active passives/status effects) Tj
T*
(  - evolution branch identity) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended layout:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Top: chapter/battle progress, enemy name/type, enemy HP) Tj
T*
(- Center: large battle scene with dragon and enemy taking most of the screen) Tj
T*
(- Bottom: dragon HP, roguelike XP bar, skill icons/status row) Tj
T*
(- Corner: compact info button, pause/settings/reduced-motion if needed) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(STAT MODEL) Tj
T*
(----------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Stats should be readable, impactful, and visually expressed in battle.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Core Stats) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- HP - survivability; visible as dragon health bar.) Tj
T*
(- Attack - base damage for claws, bite, tail, and many skills.) Tj
T*
(- Defense - flat/percent damage reduction; visible via smaller incoming numbers.) Tj
T*
(- Speed - turn frequency, attack cadence, and some dodge/initiative checks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Offensive Build Stats) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Crit Chance - chance for critical hit.) Tj
T*
(- Crit Damage - critical damage multiplier.) Tj
T*
(- Combo Chance - chance to add an extra hit after an attack.) Tj
T*
(- Skill Damage - boosts active/passive skill effects.) Tj
T*
(- Breath Damage - boosts elemental breath attacks.) Tj
T*
(- Element Damage - boosts fire/water/earth/light/dark effects.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
